(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF COMMERCE AND INDUSTRY) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: CREDIT GUARANTEE SCHEME FOR STARTUPS \(CGSS\) \(CGSS\) / NATIONAL CREDIT GUARANTEE TRUSTEE COMPANY \(NCGTC\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Provides credit guarantees to loans extended by Scheduled Commercial Banks,) Tj
T*
(NBFCs, and AIFs to DPIIT-recognized startups without collateral.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT-recognized Startups with verified GST and operational bank) Tj
T*
(   records.) Tj
T*
(2. Startups seeking debt financing without third-party collateral.) Tj
T*
(3. No default in any existing credit facility.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Credit guarantee coverage up to 85% of sanctioned facility up to Rs. 10) Tj
T*
(   Crore per startup borrower.) Tj
T*
(2. Concession or margin money subsidy rate of 85.0 % subsidy.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 10.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. DPIIT Startup Certificate) Tj
T*
(2. Audited Balance Sheets \(where available\)) Tj
T*
(3. Bank Loan Appraisal Report) Tj
T*
(4. Promoter KYC Documents) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Through Member Lending Institutions \(Banks/NBFCs\)) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.startupindia.gov.in/content/sih/en/compendium-of-schemes.html) Tj
T*
ET
